      "root_cause": "Two causes, both product defects. The planner's passage-key pattern could not parse a sectioned Samavedic citation, so passage lookup never ran for any of the 1,844 Samavedic mantras and the packet came back empty; and the scope line's 'contains NO Aranyaka' collided with ARANYA, one of the four sections of the Kauthuma arcika, which the product itself cites as 'SV ARANYA 1.1'. Told only the genre statement, the model correctly obeyed it and denied that a verse this graph stores exists at all. Absence was asserted from an empty retrieval.",
